a173989bd4daacaa553cba226136ea","node_id":"C_kwDOTWnCF9oAKDFjNGUxMmY2ZmRhMTczOTg5YmQ0ZGFhY2FhNTUzY2JhMjI2MTM2ZWE","commit":{"author":{"name":"tzhouam","email":"tzhouam@gmail.com","date":"2026-08-28T06:34:19Z"},"committer":{"name":"tzhouam","email":"tzhouam@gmail.com","date":"2026-08-28T07:33:32Z"},"message":"doc(SPEC): cover the harvest step; re-verify the pages this PR touched\n\nCI's spec-freshness gate flagged config, engine/steps/pr, and\nplaybooks/PLAYBOOKS as stale. engine/steps/pr now documents\npr.harvest_debug_knowledge (12th step, deterministic/knowledge) with its\ninvariant — real-push-only, verified-fixes-only, deliberately fail-open,\noutputs-map consumption restored on resume; config lists\nknowledge_intake_dir; GUIDE §5's pr-debug chain gains the harvest hop;\nPLAYBOOKS re-verified unchanged. All three doc gates pass locally.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EwmmhpCK9pfEsWWzUBx3GB","tree":{"sha":"acd1f78594db6c25d4bde5ced82b7a278f20282d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/git/trees/acd1f78594db6c25d4bde5ced82b7a278f20282d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/git/commits/1c4e12f6fda173989bd4daacaa553cba226136ea","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/commits/1c4e12f6fda173989bd4daacaa553cba226136ea","html_url":"https://github.com/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/commit/1c4e12f6fda173989bd4daacaa553cba226136ea","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/commits/1c4e12f6fda173989bd4daacaa553cba226136ea/comments","author":null,"committer":null,"parents":[{"sha":"7a9377f7c3ca579fbd8f2712d2470fb2c333fe51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/commits/7a9377f7c3ca579fbd8f2712d2470fb2c333fe51","html_url":"https://github.com/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/commit/7a9377f7c3ca579fbd8f2712d2470fb2c333fe51"}]},{"sha":"7a9377f7c3ca579fbd8f2712d2470fb2c333fe51","node_id":"C_kwDOTWnCF9oAKDdhOTM3N2Y3YzNjYTU3OWZiZDhmMjcxMmQyNDcwZmIyYzMzM2ZlNTE","commit":{"author":{"name":"tzhouam","email":"tzhouam@gmail.com","date":"2026-08-28T06:17:55Z"},"committer":{"name":"tzhouam","email":"tzhouam@gmail.com","date":"2026-08-28T07:32:39Z"},"message":"doc: RFC for the knowledge-intake loop, indexed in the doc map\n\nRFC-knowledge-intake.md records the design behind this PR and its\nreviewbot half (omni-reviewbot #21/#22): why the promotion gate is a\nreviewed PR rather than any direct write, the three decoupled stages\n(recording, daily distillation, fork-based publication) with their\nfail-closed and fail-open choices, the cross-repo drop-record contract\nand where it is pinned by tests, the fit with this repo's invariants,\nthe alternatives that were rejected, and the flag-by-flag rollout.\nIndexed as a features row in doc/README.md (the single directory);\nboth doc validators pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EwmmhpCK9pfEsWWzUBx3GB","tree":{"sha":"2875071f4382cee33be2228ee25c85f9ff676c6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/git/trees/2875071f4382cee33be2228ee25c85f9ff676c6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/git/commits/7a9377f7c3ca579fbd8f2712d2470fb2c333fe51","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/commits/7a9377f7c3ca579fbd8f2712d2470fb2c333fe51","html_url":"https://github.com/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/commit/7a9377f7c3ca579fbd8f2712d2470fb2c333fe51","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/commits/7a9377f7c3ca579fbd8f2712d2470fb2c333fe51/comments","author":null,"committer":null,"parents":[{"sha":"0f9c9771e969e987a42f220d4ad82abd823fa3d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/commits/0f9c9771e969e987a42f220d4ad82abd823fa3d4","html_url":"https://github.com/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/commit/0f9c9771e969e987a42f220d4ad82abd823fa3d4"}]},{"sha":"0f9c9771e969e987a42f220d4ad82abd823fa3d4","node_id":"C_kwDOTWnCF9oAKDBmOWM5NzcxZTk2OWU5ODdhNDJmMjIwZDRhZDgyYWJkODIzZmEzZDQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"tzhouam","email":"tzhouam@gmail.com","date":"2026-08-28T05:36:35Z"},"committer":{"name":"tzhouam","email":"tzhouam@gmail.com","date":"2026-08-28T07:32:38Z"},"message":"e2e: run the harvest step through the real executor, resume included\n\nTwo executor-driven tests replace hand-built state with the engine's\nown outputs map: a full debug->push->harvest playbook run drops the\nrecord end to end, and a crash-before-harvest followed by a resume over\nthe same run dir proves the checkpoint restore path feeds the harvest\nstep (completed steps replay from progress.json without re-executing —\nasserted by invocation count, since the cached summary is replayed\nverbatim). The e2e boundary is the process edge: the agent LLM and git\npush are simulated as registered steps; engine, checkpointing, and the\nharvest step itself are real.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EwmmhpCK9pfEsWWzUBx3GB","tree":{"sha":"a4e1b4ca7d0beb073c5ef30237819eaaa3108a52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/git/trees/a4e1b4ca7d0beb073c5ef30237819eaaa3108a52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/git/commits/0f9c9771e969e987a42f220d4ad82abd823fa3d4","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/commits/0f9c9771e969e987a42f220d4ad82abd823fa3d4","html_url":"https://github.com/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/commit/0f9c9771e969e987a42f220d4ad82abd823fa3d4","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/commits/0f9c9771e969e987a42f220d4ad82abd823fa3d4/comments","author":null,"committer":null,"parents":[{"sha":"8ed715afbf333fe05046f17c3e953c61fef90f32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/commits/8ed715afbf333fe05046f17c3e953c61fef90f32","html_url":"https://github.com/JiusiServe/InferMatrixCopilot/commit/8ed715afbf333fe05046f17c3e953c61fef90f32"}]}]